OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny fog soon clearing this
OL,6,Fmorning. Otherwise it will be dry
OL,7,Facross all parts with variable amounts
OL,8,Fof cloud and some spells of sunshine.
OL,9,FWarm, but cooler onshore breezes along
OL,10,Fthe east coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,13,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,14,Fwith clear periods. A few fog patches
OL,15,Fdeveloping across eastern
OL,16,FAberdeenshire.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with the chance
OL,19,Fof a few showers, these mainly over
OL,20,Fthe hills. Best of the brightness
OL,21,Facross the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
